ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKvbIw4dHgpqD9Yt3VO7h26dtmP8aeJWlh1wDFnos8zsg&oe=6A9EBC36"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Friendly Chimps", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Friendly Chimps\n\nSwing, climb, and explore in Friendly Chimps, a fun social VR adventure inspired by classic movement-based monkey games. Use your arms to move through exciting maps, hang out with friends, discover secrets, and enjoy a welcoming community.\n\nFeatures:\n\nFast and intuitive locomotion\nMultiplayer social gameplay\nUnique maps and environments\nCosmetics and customization\nRegular updates and new content\nFriendly community-focused experience\n\nWhether you're exploring, competing, or just having fun with friends, Friendly Chimps offers an exciting VR experience for players of all skill levels.\n\nNote: Friendly Chimps is a fan-made project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Another Axiom or Gorilla Tag.", "short_description": "Friendly Chimps\n\nSwing, climb, and explore in Friendly Chimps, a fun social VR adventure inspired by classic movement-based monkey games. Use your arms to move through exciting maps, hang out with friends, discover secrets, and enjoy a welcoming community.\n\nFeatures:\n\nFast and intuitive locomotion\nMultiplayer social gameplay\nUnique maps and environments\nCosmetics and customization\nRegular updates and new content\nFriendly community-focused experience"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wlmnw3JZk2GpGwWGYqS4VV8vDId-UEEo9o6lWGE70o8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Snowy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/friendlychimps/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "45